WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.569
Harry and Oliver were watching baseball on TV.

2
00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:11.280
Soon Emmy joined them.

3
00:00:11.281 --> 00:00:15.015
"What's the score?" she asked.

4
00:00:15.016 --> 00:00:19.672
"The Bluebirds are losing 3-0," Harry said.

5
00:00:19.673 --> 00:00:24.350
"I'll put on my lucky blue socks," Emmy said.

6
00:00:24.351 --> 00:00:36.611
"That'll help the Bluebirds score."

7
00:00:36.612 --> 00:00:42.447
Nothing happened.

8
00:00:42.448 --> 00:00:48.268
"I'll wear my baseball hat backward," Harry said.

9
00:00:48.269 --> 00:00:55.592
"That always brings the team good luck."

10
00:00:55.593 --> 00:00:59.615
Nothing happened.

11
00:00:59.616 --> 00:01:03.366
Oliver wanted a good luck charm.

12
00:01:03.367 --> 00:01:09.244
But he couldn't think of one.

13
00:01:09.245 --> 00:01:13.245
The score was still 3-0.

14
00:01:13.246 --> 00:01:17.905
"This game is boring," Oliver said.

15
00:01:17.906 --> 00:01:25.581
He went to the kitchen and returned with a snack.

16
00:01:25.582 --> 00:01:31.005
"While you were gone, the Bluebirds scored," Harry said.

17
00:01:31.006 --> 00:01:35.271
"The score is 3-1," Emmy said.

18
00:01:35.272 --> 00:01:38.570
Oliver ate his snack.

19
00:01:38.571 --> 00:01:44.381
"Now I'm thirsty." He left the room.

20
00:01:44.382 --> 00:01:48.642
From the kitchen, Oliver heard cheering.

21
00:01:48.643 --> 00:01:51.683
He ran back to the TV.

22
00:01:51.684 --> 00:01:56.543
"The Bluebirds scored two runs!" Harry said.

23
00:01:56.544 --> 00:02:01.503
"The game is tied 3-3."

24
00:02:01.504 --> 00:02:07.286
"Whenever I leave, the Bluebirds score," Oliver said.

25
00:02:07.287 --> 00:02:11.631
"You're their lucky charm," Emmy said.

26
00:02:11.632 --> 00:02:15.413
Oliver thought for a minute.

27
00:02:15.414 --> 00:02:19.677
"Maybe I should stay in the kitchen."

28
00:02:19.678 --> 00:02:22.544
"Yes!" Harry said.

29
00:02:22.545 --> 00:02:32.486
Oliver sat in the kitchen for the last three innings.

30
00:02:32.487 --> 00:02:36.071
"Good news, Oliver!" Emmy cried.

31
00:02:36.072 --> 00:02:47.314
"The Bluebirds just won!"

32
00:02:47.315 --> 00:02:54.175
Oliver sighed. "I'm glad they won.

33
00:02:54.176 --> 00:02:59.128
But I missed the most exciting innings!"

